- Layout of one node, as the four decisions a flex box actually takes: which way
- the children go, how they line up across and along it, how far apart they are,
- and whether this node stretches inside its own parent. Plus the width of the
- page, which is the same kind of fact and is what an artboard is set by.
-
- Every one of them is a key of the ordinary `style` dictionary of the node, so
- what this panel writes is what a hand written document would carry, and an export
- needs to know nothing about artboards at all.
- @see ../../../ARCHITECTURE.md section 8
$bog_vmap_app_inspect_flex $mol_view
	- Two way: this is the whole surface of the panel, and the document is the
	- owner's to write.
	value*? \
	sub /
		<= Width $bog_vmap_app_inspect_flex_row
			title \Ширина
			Field <= Width_pick $mol_switch
				value? <=> width? \
				options *
					390px \мобильная
					768px \планшет
					1280px \десктоп
		<= Direction $bog_vmap_app_inspect_flex_row
			title \Направление
			Field <= Direction_pick $mol_switch
				value? <=> direction? \
				options *
					column \колонкой
					row \рядом
		<= Across $bog_vmap_app_inspect_flex_row
			title \Поперёк
			Field <= Across_pick $mol_switch
				value? <=> across? \
				options *
					flex-start \к началу
					center \по центру
					flex-end \к концу
					stretch \во всю
		<= Along $bog_vmap_app_inspect_flex_row
			title \Вдоль
			Field <= Along_pick $mol_switch
				value? <=> along? \
				options *
					flex-start \к началу
					center \по центру
					flex-end \к концу
					space-between \по краям
		<= Gap $bog_vmap_app_inspect_flex_row
			title \Зазор
			Field <= Gap_field $mol_string
				hint \1rem
				value? <=> gap? \
		<= Grow $bog_vmap_app_inspect_flex_row
			title \Растяжение
			Field <= Grow_check $mol_check
				title \занимать свободное место
				checked? <=> grow? false

- One line of the panel: what is being set, and the control setting it.
$bog_vmap_app_inspect_flex_row $mol_view
	title \
	Field $mol_view
	sub /
		<= Title $mol_view sub / <= title
		<= Field
